        "locale": "en_US",
        "rating": 10,
        "text": "Beautiful home, close to the beach, and very easy to communicate with management. We really enjoyed the home- it was exceptionally clean and had very nice amenities. There are good views from the house, and the multiple decks provided hours of relaxation. The beach was less than a 5 minute walk. We had to reach out to management a few times, and every time they were extremely prompt in both response and solution. Just FYI before coming- beach/pool towels are not included, and there is an extra daily fee to heat the pool. Overall, the home was beautiful and clean, the amenities were very nice, and the location was great!",
